This paragraph has a name, and is usually rendered with a modest subheading.\footnote{\quad \iffollowsheading\par\noindent\fi\followsheadingfalse
Also two footnotes.

}
There is very little else to it.\footnote{\quad \iffollowsheading\par\noindent\fi\followsheadingfalse
Save for the formula $n\mapsto 3n + 1$.

}


